One minor edge case to note: zombies on Normal difficulty can pick up dropped items. If the player somehow drops the iron sword, the zombie could pick it up and become harder to kill. However, this is an extremely unlikely edge case for an AI agent (it would need to deliberately press the drop key), and even if it happened, the player can still punch the zombie to death (just takes longer). This doesn't affect benchmark validity.

